		<h1>RotoFlex II Pump Hose Replacement - RTX 650, 900, 1250</h1>
		<div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="bold h4">Also see</span>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                        <li>
                            RotoFlex instructions for:<br>
                            <a href="RotoFlex-RTX-750-1000">RTX 750 &amp; RTX 1000</a>
                        </li>
